>
  <p>Markham is two cities in one for concrete work. The older streets around Unionville and Milliken have mature homes with driveways and walkways from the 70s and 80s that are reaching the end of their run. The newer subdivisions in Cornell, Wismer and the north end have the opposite problem: builder-grade flatwork poured thin over minimal base, already cracking and settling within its first decade or two. <a href="/">Concrete Toronto</a> works across all of it, and we back each job with a 2-year warranty.</p>

  <p>Both problems have the same root cause: what is underneath the concrete. When we replace a driveway or walkway, we excavate to a proper depth, compact a granular base, and pour a mix suited to York Region's freeze-thaw winters. The surface above a good base stays flat for decades.</p>

  <h2>Markham concrete work, service by service</h2>
  <p>Where the Markham calls tend to go:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-driveways/">Concrete driveways</a>, replacements of tired or builder-grade pours</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-patios/">Backyard patios</a> sized to how you actually use the yard</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-walkways/">Front walkways</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-sidewalks/">sidewalk sections</a></li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-porches/">Porches</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-steps/">steps</a>, repaired or rebuilt</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-slabs/">Slabs</a> for sheds and garages, plus <a href="/services/parging/">parging</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-repair/">repair</a> work</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>One crew for the whole frontage</h2>
  <p>Markham frontages often need the driveway, walkway and porch steps done together. Because our crew handles all of it, you get one quote, one schedule and one cleanup, and the finishes match. We will also tell you honestly if part of the work only needs a <a href="/services/concrete-repair/">repair</a> rather than a full <a href="/services/concrete-replacement/">replacement</a>.</p>

  <h2>What Markham customers get</h2>
  <p>A crew that has spent fifteen years on GTA flatwork, an honest read on whether to repair or replace, and a written quote you can sit with. Schedules get kept, and sites get left clean.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>2-year warranty, standard on every job</li>
    <li>Satisfaction guaranteed at the end of it</li>
    <li>Quotes are free and never pushy</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Send photos and a few lines through the form and we will take it from there, following the same clear <a href="/#process">six-step process</a> we use on every job. Next door in <a href="/locations/richmond-hill/">Richmond Hill</a> or <a href="/locations/vaughan/">Vaughan</a>? One call covers family and rental properties there too.</p>
